{"title":"2006 Seniors Pancyprian/2nd grade/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Seniors_Pancyprian/2nd_grade/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find all three digit numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/f/fbf70eb3b43764a9e9ffe1942ef123fc011fe2a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{xyz}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />(<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/3/ed3b8df8c6defada084d1595fdf309a14376481d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=100x+10y+z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"137\" height=\"16\" />) for which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/b/45be6a58a9654f7997ad9307495f54be8307dd7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac {7}{4}(\\overline{xyz})=\\overline{zyx}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"110\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Seniors_Pancyprian/2nd_grade/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/7/787f32d68536f5e4af34e54bad5e0d47422c817b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$175x+\\frac{35}{2}y+\\frac{7}{4}z=100z+10y+x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"279\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/7/487b99be37f3ee29aeea8506f471ea0dbf913ed4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$174x+\\frac{15}{2}y-\\frac{393}{4}z=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"187\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/5/035f04670a24b0604ab494a4e07f0b8c80e0e223.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$232x+10y-131z=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"179\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>We can now make some conclusions. z is even, so z can be only 2, 4, 6, or 8, since 0 is an extraneous solution. Now if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/6/5e6dc42bb0d892a136cd56c48b13585b42428825.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z=2$\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/5/4c52e02a35db152495396584bfeae1d0599cd753.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/b/a2b0e1404de4eca35c42876bcc83707b753e990e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"45\" height=\"17\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/b/04ba49e85bb40e9b9f5326f02560e691b73ac2ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/2/69271b422e022ea65ff1f288eddfcfa82afd8ab7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/a/daaf07d9f0a2413768e291d1264b59b3c835e4aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"45\" height=\"17\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/6/7d627a16a6871c2f4b62f503a1a57b665af3e399.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z=6$\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/2/b022dc8ef6d33931fc1ae3d27df3ea0a81b52936.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/c/08c1b3337268879246336b597a1b8d88b2f17019.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/e/2be940191460cd30cc15596e01d6d7c52006dad3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z=8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/7/2e7d65cfa316d639c9267398009812f3eb45fea9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, but there are no solutions for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />. Thus only <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/5/17531b756bc19a5c07c7f1ab8ce1cddf4bb4097c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$132$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/d/f8ddc8fc71a12bc811232ab5dac94baef5c24945.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$264$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"27\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/8/dc8f1c96e4e8d38319bca5ab83d235fc5423b2bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$396$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> work.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Seniors_Pancyprian/2nd_grade/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Seniors_Pancyprian/2nd_grade/Problem_3\" title=\"2006 Seniors Pancyprian/2nd grade/Problem 3\">Next Problem</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Seniors_Pancyprian/2nd_grade/Problem_1\" title=\"2006 Seniors Pancyprian/2nd grade/Problem 1\">Previous Problem</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Seniors_Pancyprian/2nd_grade\" title=\"2006 Seniors Pancyprian/2nd grade\">Back to Exam</a></li></ul>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Seniors_Pancyprian_Competition\" title=\"Seniors Pancyprian Competition\">Seniors Pancyprian Competition</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Seniors_Pancyprian_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"Seniors Pancyprian Problems and Solutions\">Seniors Pancyprian Problems and Solutions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competition_resources\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competition resources\">Mathematics competition resources</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017151925\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.015 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.087 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 113/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3694/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:4357:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017151925 and revision id 32884. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}